{"4170040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We need a doorman.", "steam_appid": 4170040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We need a doorman.&quot; is a unique horror simulation that merges the role of a doorman with the ritual of demon exorcism.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 90 types of anomalies are prepared.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Role of the Doorman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a simple hotel doorman. In this peculiar hotel where the living and the dead intersect, your primary duty is to prevent demons from invading the realm of the living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since demons are masters of deception, you must meticulously observe even the smallest features of your guests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you detect a demonic trait, do not hesitate—use force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/140c45990c72e9f290ea506176ec05b7.poster.avif?t=1777528876\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/140c45990c72e9f290ea506176ec05b7.webm?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/140c45990c72e9f290ea506176ec05b7.mp4?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lobby Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the hotel will accumulate trash. Though cumbersome, you must personally dispose of the garbage by placing it in the incinerator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, maintain the hotel's elegance and dignity by timely management of the potted plants and the aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demonic Curses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned: If you mistakenly allow a demon onto the elevator, or if you neglect a demon for too long within this spatially unique hotel, they will cast terrifying curses upon you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want your heart to skip a beat, quickly identify and exorcise your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/52cbfb9a963d23602126a00495a1206c.poster.avif?t=1777528876\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/52cbfb9a963d23602126a00495a1206c.webm?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seeking the True Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone's note contained this message:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Only by finding the true Sacred Relics can it be sealed.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find the Relics hidden in the hotel and thwart the mastermind behind it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/8e389b86643152f90db974190d44845d.poster.avif?t=1777528876\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/8e389b86643152f90db974190d44845d.webm?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the unique doorman profession that merges horror and simulation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can upload or stream video without any restrictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;We need a doorman.&quot; is a unique horror simulation that merges the role of a doorman with the ritual of demon exorcism.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 90 types of anomalies are prepared.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Role of the Doorman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are not just a simple hotel doorman. In this peculiar hotel where the living and the dead intersect, your primary duty is to prevent demons from invading the realm of the living. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since demons are masters of deception, you must meticulously observe even the smallest features of your guests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you detect a demonic trait, do not hesitate—use force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/140c45990c72e9f290ea506176ec05b7.poster.avif?t=1777528876\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/140c45990c72e9f290ea506176ec05b7.webm?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/140c45990c72e9f290ea506176ec05b7.mp4?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lobby Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the hotel will accumulate trash. Though cumbersome, you must personally dispose of the garbage by placing it in the incinerator. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furthermore, maintain the hotel's elegance and dignity by timely management of the potted plants and the aquarium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demonic Curses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be warned: If you mistakenly allow a demon onto the elevator, or if you neglect a demon for too long within this spatially unique hotel, they will cast terrifying curses upon you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't want your heart to skip a beat, quickly identify and exorcise your guests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/52cbfb9a963d23602126a00495a1206c.poster.avif?t=1777528876\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/52cbfb9a963d23602126a00495a1206c.webm?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Seeking the True Relics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Someone's note contained this message:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Only by finding the true Sacred Relics can it be sealed.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find the Relics hidden in the hotel and thwart the mastermind behind it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/8e389b86643152f90db974190d44845d.poster.avif?t=1777528876\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4170040/extras/8e389b86643152f90db974190d44845d.webm?t=1777528876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the unique doorman profession that merges horror and simulation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>